      "id": "concept_6",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "For a perfect square with n digits, the chapter gives the number of digits in its square root:\n\nIf n is even: n/2.\nIf n is odd: (n+1)/2.\n\nThis is a fast size check before any long division.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
